	(text "Switch off: both EN low, nothing draws from the pack. The\nswitch is fed from the pack side (CHG_SYS) or the 12 V jack\nthrough a diode-OR. Pole 2 breaks CC1 (PD renegotiates at\nswitch-on); CC2 is direct, so with the plug the other way round\nthe charger also works with the switch off. Bridge the CC1\njumper to leave CC1 unswitched. EN dividers: on above about\n8.7 V. 12 V present: the FET holds the pack eFuse off, so\nV_BUS comes from the jack (no charging from 12 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8da19081-75d6-5d0a-bf3d-268c02d760ca")
	)
